  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: add TreatWarningsAsErrors to SDK project template 2026-03-27\n- feat: Inline array support and deepObject serialization for object query params 2026-03-22\n- feat: Extract inline object schemas from bindings and skip object-type query params 2026-03-21\n- feat: Extract inline enum schemas from bindings.ws.query to components 2026-03-21\n- feat: Support inline schemas in bindings.ws.query + snapshot test 2026-03-21\n- feat: Generate typed ConnectAsync with query params from AsyncAPI channel bindings 2026-03-21\n- feat: Native upstream AsyncAPI spec support — inline payloads, per-channel servers, operationTraits 2026-03-21\n- feat: Add const discriminator support for AsyncAPI specs 2026-03-21\n- feat: Add unit tests for DeriveNameFromMethodAndPath and strip more version prefixes 2026-03-21\n- feat: Derive request/response type names from method+path when operationId is missing (#181) 2026-03-21\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: resolve issue regressions in generated clients 2026-03-28\n- fix: avoid explicit type info name collisions 2026-03-28\n- fix: avoid STJ built-in type info collisions 2026-03-28\n- fix: use friendly auth constructor file names 2026-03-28\n- fix: skip built-in types in struct-nullable SYSLIB1031 detection 2026-03-28\n- fix: detect struct-nullable SYSLIB1031 collisions in JsonSerializerContext 2026-03-28\n- fix: avoid serializer context type info collisions 2026-03-28\n- fix: use portable typedata hash combiner 2026-03-27\n- fix: use $OpenApiSpec$ placeholder in README template instead of hardcoded AssemblyAI URL 2026-03-27\n- fix: relax generic allof validation 2026-03-26",
